      "statement": "find_device resolves a query in order: the 'pipewire:'-prefixed id of a listed sink; an exact bare id, 'host:id' or device name; an exact sink name; a case-insensitive substring of a sink name; a case-insensitive substring of a device id or name; otherwise it fails with DeviceNotFound.",
